{"status":"completed","summary":"Published node1's approved release tree as the read-only rsync module `releases`. Node2 retrieved and verified the complete tree with modes and symlinks intact. Writes and outside-tree access are denied. Both nodes were restarted sequentially and recovered with changed boot identities. Ubuntu 24.04 and kernel 6.8.0-71 were retained.","actions_performed":["Configured `/etc/rsyncd.conf` on node1 with chroot and read-only access rooted at `/srv/legacy2/rsync-module-publication/releases`.","Restricted module access to node2 and enabled the packaged rsync service.","Retrieved and checksum-verified the tree on node2, preserving `current -> v1`, file modes, and executable permissions.","Verified upload, traversal, private-module, and unauthorized-client attempts are rejected.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually and verified post-restart recovery and persistence."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Publish a read-only module named releases","command_ids":["cmd-950d056d5dfc4a8c","cmd-13c93be80f82432f","cmd-55c604e52d2e430b"],"summary":"The persistent module is rooted at the releases subtree, chrooted, read-only, enabled, active, and listening on TCP 873."},{"requirement":"Node2 retrieves the full tree with modes and symlinks intact","command_ids":["cmd-13c93be80f82432f","cmd-a7a81c96e406464a"],"summary":"Fresh pre- and post-restart retrievals preserved README mode 0644, client mode 0755, directories 0755, `current -> v1`, and matching SHA-256 hashes."},{"requirement":"Writes and outside-tree access are denied","command_ids":["cmd-13c93be80f82432f","cmd-a7a81c96e406464a","cmd-55c604e52d2e430b"],"summary":"Upload attempts returned `module is read only`; traversal and private-module requests failed; no probe files appeared on node1. Non-node2 access was also rejected."},{"requirement":"Preserve the approved release and private data","command_ids":["cmd-1460964fae2b4a93","cmd-a4b539d2242c491f","cmd-a7a81c96e406464a","cmd-55c604e52d2e430b"],"summar